  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The number of real values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>, such that the system of linear equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;has no solutions, is</p>"
  },
