  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>For the system of linear equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;to have&nbsp;no solutions,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo></math>&nbsp;should be equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>43</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>43</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;as for the above quadratic the value of determinant is greater than zero.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;satisfy the system of equations to obtain no solution.</p></blockquote>"
